00:20:00.250 --> 00:20:02.910
Oh, that old fool, he doesn't bother us, does he?

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:03.650
Well, he should do.

00:20:04.000 --> 00:20:04.840
Don't you remember his sermon?

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:09.800
I respect atheists, idolaters and cannibals, he said.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:13.400
And he opposed the gun law, which we all know was God's will.

00:20:14.330 --> 00:20:17.700
And last Christmas, while you were away on pilgrimage duty,

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:23.040
he preached that not only was Mary not a virgin,

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.650
she was also technically a surrogate mother.

00:20:30.990 --> 00:20:31.950
He never did.

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.330
Cross my heart.

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.620
In fact, not only is the Bishop of Halton Price

00:20:37.620 --> 00:20:39.300
but most certainly an unbeliever,

00:20:41.490 --> 00:20:44.050
I suspect he is the secret leader

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:46.490
of all who oppose the will of God.

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:48.420
You don't mean...

00:20:54.170 --> 00:20:56.580
What do you think?

00:20:57.990 --> 00:20:59.190
The Almighty says you're right.

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:07.540
Yes, your dossier. He says it's the least we can do.

00:21:07.680 --> 00:21:10.760
Right, I'm on my way. I will be done.

00:21:16.980 --> 00:21:19.400
Can I speak to Deputy Chief Constable Ginsberg, please?

00:22:02.750 --> 00:22:03.870
Sonanakawa

00:22:35.756 --> 00:22:38.216
He should never have passed his probationary period.

00:22:39.180 --> 00:22:43.560
He was hearing voices ten years before the introduction of personal radios.

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:46.820
You need to force a good turn, sir.

00:22:47.116 --> 00:22:48.756
Good arse, you're not me, Shigeru.

00:22:50.956 --> 00:22:51.456
Puppet Duty.

00:22:51.980 --> 00:22:53.440
Chief Constable Ginsberg.

00:22:54.092 --> 00:22:55.092
Thank you.

00:22:56.076 --> 00:22:56.896
Chief Constable.

00:22:58.156 --> 00:22:58.656
That's the right.

00:22:59.500 --> 00:23:00.000
Now I'm...

00:23:02.050 --> 00:23:06.060
So, if there's any little fibre of it.

00:23:08.150 --> 00:23:11.370
Well, has your force placed in order for handguns yet?

00:23:11.810 --> 00:23:14.700
Because I can get them for you, you know, wholesale.

00:23:32.748 --> 00:23:34.088
Blimey, who's that? Dennis Waterman?

00:23:34.604 --> 00:23:35.584
What does it say on the radar?

00:23:36.620 --> 00:23:38.620
Made in Taiwan.

00:23:41.196 --> 00:23:41.856
Let's say.

00:23:42.124 --> 00:23:43.164
A hundred and ten.

00:23:43.660 --> 00:23:44.940
Let's get him a rich sod.

00:23:45.228 --> 00:23:46.228
Thank you.

00:23:53.100 --> 00:23:54.240
The guitar on it

00:24:00.810 --> 00:24:03.840
So Hertfordshire police have bought 500 guns.

00:24:04.300 --> 00:24:05.820
Great. Well done, Norman.

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:07.240
Or is it Norma?

00:24:14.120 --> 00:24:25.220
Not slowing down.

00:24:25.670 --> 00:24:27.950
Shall I have a pop against tyres like they do on a telly?

00:25:00.410 --> 00:25:00.610
Thank you.
